{"availability":"available","full":"SarvarKh/Role-playing-game_phaser","name":"Role-playing-game_phaser","description":"Desert conqueror - 2D RPG game running only on browsers and built with Phaser 3. The player's job is to collect as many coins as possible trying to avoid a bomb attacks. So the player should keep collecting coins avoding collision with any moving bombs. For each coin collected, there will be another new coin be created along with moving bombs. The main objective of the game is to keep the bombs at a distance and collect coins as much as possible. If player collides with any moving bomb, the game will end.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2021-06-26T12:15:36Z","updated":"2021-07-06T08:23:47Z","branch":"development","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://desert-conqueror.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.552Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.552Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.552Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.552Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a Desert Conqueror - 2D RPG game built with Javascript and the game engine Phaser library.","Desert conqueror - 2D RPG game running only on browsers and built with Phaser 3. The player's job is to collect as many coins as possible trying to avoid a bomb attacks. So the player should keep collecting coins avoding collision with any moving bombs. For each coin collected, there will be another new coin be created along with moving bombs. The main objective of the game is to keep the bombs at a distance and collect coins as much as possible. If player collides with any moving bomb, the game will end.","For each coin you collect, points will be added to your score. In the end, you will be added to the leaderboard if you come out among the best."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SarvarKh/Role-playing-game_phaser